35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The offshore house is 5,400 yen a head a night. That's cheap.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,All-in rates charge the same for everyone. Separate meals vary by appetite.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island house has one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year, we didn't meet for half the day. A shared house has no private space.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, one bathroom? That sounds like a nightmare for five people.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train option is much faster. I prefer the spa town.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the all-in rate is predictable. That solves my concern about billing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, the spa town has fixed meal times. I hate being rushed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, if we go to the city, we can have separate rooms. That solves the crowding.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The city bed is 12,000 to 20,000 yen. That's expensive.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The city has trains every few minutes. No planning needed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The city allows separate billing. That is fairer for those who eat less.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The city room has a door. I can sleep without being woken up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The city lets us be alone if we want. But we might not see each other.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I like the predictability of the island, but the bathroom is a dealbreaker.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"The spa town is a compromise. Fast travel, but rigid schedule.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The city is the most flexible. I can control my own spending.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I am leaning towards the city. I need my own space to sleep.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am worried about the city. We might drift apart.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
