60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is the island. Option B is the spa town. Option C is the city.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for B. The travel time is acceptable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,I vote for C. The financial transparency is best.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,I vote for C. I need a private room to sleep well.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"I vote for B. We need to be together, not scattered.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, but the island has no private space. That's a problem.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the spa town has shared rooms, but the schedule is tight.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the city allows us to meet up if we want, but not be forced.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I agree. I can go to the public bath if I want to socialize.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, but last year we didn't meet. The city might repeat that.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I am torn. The island is cheap, but the bathroom is bad.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The spa town is a good middle ground. We are together, but not cramped.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,The city is the most logical choice for individual needs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I am sticking with the city. I need my space.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I am reconsidering. Maybe the spa town is better for us as a group.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,I will vote for the spa town. It's a balance.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am happy with that.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I will accept it. The all-in rate is predictable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Takumi,,"I will try to sleep. The fixed times are annoying, but okay.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I hope we stay connected.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
